    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Crew Type (Bad Eden): Storm Wardens.</em></p><p><strong>“Weather is only random if nobody is in charge.”</strong></p><p>Storm Wardens treat wind, flood, ashfall, and static like administrative problems. They know how to ride a storm front, ground a lightning field, and keep a faction moving when the world is trying to turn travel into a funeral.</p><ul><li><strong>Tactical Identity:</strong> You gain a skill rank in Lore and Faith.</li><li><strong>Strategic Identity:</strong> Your faction starts with +1 Faith OPs.</li></ul>",
